<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/8th-century">8th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">737 CE</h1><p class="ref-lede">737 CE in world history: 3 events, 1 birth and 2 deaths. 269 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
