<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/muslim-conquest-of-transoxiana" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/muslim-conquest-of-transoxiana.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/september-30">30 September</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Türgesh tribesmen capture the baggage train of an Umayyad army</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Retreating across the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oxus">Oxus</a> from Khuttal, the Umayyad army of Asad ibn Abdallah al-Qasri lost its baggage train, sent ahead, to the pursuing Türgesh. The failed campaign ended Arab control of the upper Oxus valley and opened Khurasan to the Türgesh.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/muslim-conquest-of-transoxiana">Muslim conquest of Transoxiana</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/umayyad-caliphate">Umayyad Caliphate</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-kharistan">Battle of Kharistan</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Kharistan was fought in December 737 in Guzgan, in present-day northern Afghanistan.</p></div></li></ol></section>
